sequenceDiagram
    participant UE as UE / Device
    participant AMF as AMF
    participant NRF as NRF
    participant AUSF as AUSF
    participant UDM as UDM
    participant SMF as SMF
    participant UPF as UPF

    UE->>AMF: Attach Request (IMSI)
    AMF->>NRF: Discover AUSF
    NRF-->>AMF: AUSF endpoint
    AMF->>AUSF: Authenticate(IMSI)
    AUSF-->>AMF: Auth token / security context

    AMF->>NRF: Discover UDM
    NRF-->>AMF: UDM endpoint
    AMF->>UDM: Subscriber Profile Request
    UDM-->>AMF: Allowed slicing + default DNN

    AMF->>NRF: Discover SMF
    NRF-->>AMF: SMF endpoint
    AMF->>SMF: Create PDU Session
    SMF->>UPF: Configure forwarding
    SMF-->>AMF: Session context + UPF anchor

    AMF-->>UE: Attach accepted / session ready
